="50.926" end="51.287">时</span></p><p begin="51.297" end="55.786" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.297" end="51.757">发现</span><span begin="51.757" end="52.632">我没</span><span begin="52.632" end="53.042">太</span><span begin="53.109" end="53.524">多的</span><span begin="53.524" end="54.402">心去</span><span begin="54.402" end="54.640">等</span><span begin="54.640" end="55.786">待</span></p><p begin="56.251" end="59.685" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.251" end="56.990">它失去</span><span begin="56.990" end="58.239">某种色</span><span begin="58.239" end="59.685">彩</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.789" end="1:31.567" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:01.789" end="1:04.848" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.789" end="1:02.281">得</span><span begin="1:02.281" end="1:03.094">不到</span><span begin="1:03.094" end="1:03.510">的就</span><span begin="1:03.510" end="1:04.398">更加</span><span begin="1:04.398" end="1:04.848">爱</span></p><p begin="1:05.294" end="1:08.320" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.294" end="1:05.714">太</span><span begin="1:05.714" end="1:06.121">容易</span><span begin="1:06.121" end="1:06.536">来</span><span begin="1:06.536" end="1:06.907">的</span><span begin="1:06.950" end="1:07.419">就</span><span begin="1:07.419" end="1:07.826">不理</span><span begin="1:07.826" end="1:08.320">睬</span></p><p begin="1:08.320" end="1:12.124" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.320" end="1:08.543">其</span><span begin="1:08.543" end="1:08.814">实</span><span begin="1:09.193" end="1:10.490">谁不想</span><span begin="1:10.490" end="1:10.907">遇</span><span begin="1:10.907" end="1:11.097">见</span><span begin="1:11.097" end="1:11.495">真</span><span begin="1:11.495" end="1:12.124">爱</span></p><p begin="1:12.231" end="1:15.778" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.231" end="1:12.668">爱</span><span begin="1:12.668" end="1:12.864">得</span><span begin="1:12.864" end="1:13.331">绝</span><span begin="1:13.331" end="1:13.734">