/span><span begin="1:53.878" end="1:55.310">爱</span></p><p begin="1:56.818" end="2:00.936" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.818" end="1:57.292">然而</span><span begin="1:57.292" end="1:58.504">爱</span> <span begin="1:58.962" end="1:59.613">总是乱</span><span begin="1:59.613" end="2:00.470">了节</span><span begin="2:00.470" end="2:00.936">拍</span></p><p begin="2:00.946" end="2:05.458" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.946" end="2:01.730">我只能够</span><span begin="2:01.730" end="2:02.175">瞎</span><span begin="2:02.175" end="2:02.616">猜</span> <span begin="2:02.679" end="2:03.514">也许能中</span><span begin="2:03.514" end="2:04.393">了头</span><span begin="2:04.393" end="2:05.458">彩</span></p><p begin="2:05.875" end="2:10.777" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.875" end="2:06.539">中了也</span><span begin="2:06.539" end="2:07.830">觉得奇</span><span begin="2:07.830" end="2:10.777">怪</span></p></div><div begin="2:11.355" end="2:41.801" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:11.355" end="2:14.544" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.355" end="2:11.847">得</span><span begin="2:11.847" end="2:12.660">不到</span><span begin="2:12.660" end="2:13.076">的就</span><span begin="2:13.076" end="2:13.964">更加</span><span begin="2:13.964" end="2:14.544">爱</span></p><p begin="2:14.838" end="2:17.841" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.838" end="2:15.258">太</span><span begin="2:15.258" end="2:15.665">容易</span><span begin="2:15.665" end="2:16.080">来</span><span begin="2:16.080" end="2:16.451">的</span><span begin="2:16.494" end="2:16.963">就</span><span begin="2:16.963" end="2:17.370">不理</span><span begin="2:17.370" end="2:17.841">睬</span></p><p begin="2:17.851" end="2:21.715" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.851" end="2:18.074">其</span><span begin="2:18.074" end="2:18.345">实</span><span begin="2:18.724" end="2:20.021">谁不想</span><span begin="2:20.021" end="2:20.438">遇</span><span begin="2:20.438" end="2:20.628">见</span><span